msgstr "Òbsłëga"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file backendselection.ui line 39
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file backendselection.ui line 42
#: rc.cpp:3 rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"A list of Phonon Backends found on your system.  The order here determines "
"the order Phonon will use them in."
msgstr ""
"Lësta programów òbsłëgùjącëch ùżëwónëch przez Phonon.  Pòsobnica "
"tuwò òdpòwiadô ti, w jaczi Phonon bãdze ji brëkòwôł."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file backendselection.ui line 58
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file outputdevicechoice.ui line 130
#: rc.cpp:9 rc.cpp:40
msgid "Prefer"
msgstr "W górã"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file backendselection.ui line 71
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file outputdevicechoice.ui line 101
#: rc.cpp:12 rc.cpp:31
msgid "Defer"
msgstr "W dół"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file outputdevicechoice.ui line 23
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file outputdevicechoice.ui line 26
#: rc.cpp:15 rc.cpp:18
msgid ""
"Various categories of outputs.  For each category you may choose what device "
"you wish to output to."
msgstr "Wszelejaczé kategòrëje wińdzeniów.  W kòżdi kategòrëji mòże wëbrac ùrządzenié wińdzenia."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file outputdevicechoice.ui line 54
#: rc.cpp:21
msgid ""
"Audio Outputs found on your system.  Choose the device that you wish sound "
"to come out of."
msgstr ""
"Wińdzenia aùdio nalazłé w systemie.  Wëbierzë ùrządzenié, z jaczégò mô "
"wëchòdzëc zwãk."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file outputdevicechoice.ui line 58
#: rc.cpp:24
msgid ""
"The order determines the preference of the output devices. If for some "
"reason the first device cannot be used Phonon will try to use the second, "
"and\n"
"so on."
msgstr ""
"Pòsobnica òpisëje preferencëje tikające sã wińdzeniów aùdio. Jeżlë z jaczichs przëczënów "
"ni mòże bëc brëkòwóné pierszé ùrządzenié na lësce, Phonon spróbùje drëdżegò, "
"ë \n"
"tak dali."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file outputdevicechoice.ui line 98
#: rc.cpp:28
msgid "no preference for the selected device"
msgstr "felënk preferencëji wëbrónegò ùrządzeniô"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file outputdevicechoice.ui line 114
#: rc.cpp:34
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Rëmôj"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file outputdevicechoice.ui line 127
#: rc.cpp:37
msgid "prefer the selected device"
msgstr "wëbierzë naznaczoné ùrządzenié"

